sequenceDiagram
    actor B as Buyer
    participant App as Desi Bazaar app
    participant A as Admin
    participant S as Seller
    B->>App: Open dispute (reason + structured evidence)
    App->>A: Queue case — SLA timers start (ack 1d, decision 5d)
    A->>S: Request evidence
    S->>A: Submit evidence
    A->>A: Mediate — record proposed outcome separately
    A->>B: Propose outcome
    A->>S: Propose outcome
    alt Parties agree: refund
        Note over S: Platform cannot move money (Phase 1)
        S->>B: Refund via direct Swish
        B->>App: Acknowledge receipt
        App->>App: remedy_acknowledged → dispute_resolved
    else Seller non-cooperation
        A->>App: Record unresolved_non_compliant
        App->>S: Proportionate restriction (human-reviewed)
        App->>B: Explain limits + external remedies info
    end
